# Myah Travels - TODO.md

## Status

**Major Architecture Pivot: Content Blocks System.**

After Myah's feedback, moving away from Canvas/design tools for writers. New direction:

**Developer controls design. Template controls layout. Writer controls content.**

---

## New Architecture: Block-Based Content

### Blocks (Content Types)
- Title
- Body (rich text)
- Hero Image
- Gallery
- Quick Facts
- Quote
- Pros & Cons
- Verdict
- Callout (Travel Tip)
- YouTube Embed
- FAQ (portal)
- Documents (portal)
- Notices (portal)

### Templates (Design)
- Story (title, hero, body, quote, gallery)
- Travel Guide (title, hero, quick facts, body, gallery)
- Review (title, hero, pros & cons, body, verdict)
- FAQ (title, accordion)

### Writer Experience
- Pick template → Fill content blocks → Preview → Publish
- NO dragging, NO resizing, NO colour pickers, NO design decisions
- Just writing

